{'symbol': 'MRNA', 'date': '2022-05-11 08:00:00', 'title': 'DEPARTURE OF JORGE GOMEZ AND CONTINUATION OF DAVID MELINE AS CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER', 'text': 'CAMBRIDGE, MA / ACCESSWIRE / MAY 11, 2022 / MODERNA, INC. (NASDAQ:MRNA), A BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANY PIONEERING MESSENGER RNA (MRNA) THERAPEUTICS AND VACCINES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS RECENTLY APPOINTED CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, JORGE GOMEZ, HAS DEPARTED THE COMPANY, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY. THE ANNOUNCEMENT FOLLOWS THE MAY 10 PUBLIC DISCLOSURE BY MR.'}